Wide 16:9 painted cloud sea for a game, seen from slightly above at the horizon: a continuous band of big soft fluffy cumulus cloud tops, with gently rounded billows and wispy soft edges, lit from above by a neutral white light, so the tops are bright white and the undersides are only pale cool grey (NO dark or black cores, low contrast, soft painterly detail, not cartoon, not cauliflower or popcorn, no hard outlines). The cloud band fills the lower 60% of the image with a soft feathered top edge that fades smoothly into the background; everything above the cloud tops and all gaps are PURE FLAT BLACK (#000000). The left and right edges must continue seamlessly (similar cloud mass at both edges). No sun, no sky colours, no objects, no text.
